{{> header}}
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card mt-5 shadow-lg border border-0">
            <div class="card-body p-5">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-8">
                        <div class="intro py-4">
                            <h4>Hi! Welcome to my profile.</h4>
                            <p>I am a fresh graduate in Informatics with a strong interest in Flutter development,
                                especially in mobile application development.
                                My final project was a smart system that involved geographic data (latitude and
                                longitude)
                                and was integrated with the Google Maps API.
                                In addition to my academic experience, I have completed several online courses on
                                platforms
                                like Udemy and BuildWithAngga, which have strengthened my technical skills.
                                I am confident that I can contribute meaningfully to any project I am involved in. I
                                enjoy
                                working in teams,
                                have a passion for learning new things, and love solving puzzles and
                                challenges—especially
                                those that require creative problem-solving.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="contact">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col">
                                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-dark rounded-pill px-4">contact</a>
                                    <a href="#" class="btn rounded-pill px-4">download CV<i
                                            class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="social-icons pt-5">
                            <a class="text-white p-0 fs-5 btn btn-dark rounded-circle"
                                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/girindra-sulistiyo-wardoyo-a01778191/"><i
                                    class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a>
                            <a class="text-white p-0 fs-5 btn btn-dark rounded-circle" href="#"><i
                                    class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a class="text-white p-0 fs-5 btn btn-dark rounded-circle" href="#"><i
                                    class="fa-brands fa-facebook"></i></a>
                            <a class="text-white p-0 fs-5 btn btn-dark rounded-circle" href="#"><i
                                    class="fa-brands fa-twitter"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="card mb-3">
                            <img src="assets/images/graduated.jpg"
                                class="card-img-top" alt="Linkedin Photo Porfile">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <h5 class="card-title text-center fw-bolder">Girindra Sulistiyo W</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-center">Web Developer</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>



